Lum: Lum's authors (Bartlomiej Kulesz i Oleh Nykorovych) as the company and copyright in
the .exe/.dll file properties. ASCII only - the resource compiler (rc) does not accept Polish
letters in these fields. The browser and installer strings (with "ł") are set by
lum/branding/rebrand_strings.py.

--- a/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
+++ b/chrome/app/theme/chromium/BRANDING
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
-COMPANY_FULLNAME=Lum
+COMPANY_FULLNAME=Bartlomiej Kulesz i Oleh Nykorovych
 COMPANY_SHORTNAME=Lum
 PRODUCT_FULLNAME=Lum
 PRODUCT_SHORTNAME=Lum
 PRODUCT_INSTALLER_FULLNAME=Lum Installer
 PRODUCT_INSTALLER_SHORTNAME=Lum Installer
-COPYRIGHT=Copyright @LASTCHANGE_YEAR@ The Chromium Authors and the Lum contributors. All rights reserved.
+COPYRIGHT=Copyright @LASTCHANGE_YEAR@ Bartlomiej Kulesz i Oleh Nykorovych. Based on Chromium.
